<title>POLAND: GPRD INCREASES Q1 LOSS TO PLN 4.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>GPRD INCREASES Q1 LOSS TO PLN 4.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>GPRD SA preliminary results</p>
<p>for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating loss			 5.75   vs    3.24</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			   4.94   vs    2.99</p>
<p>    net loss				 4.94   vs    2.99</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Gdanskie Przedsiebiorstwo</p>
<p>Robot Drogowych SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     10.19   vs    5.57</p>
<p>    costs of sales			16.21   vs    8.79</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit/loss	  0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.16   vs    0.43</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.35   vs    0.18</p>
<p>    investment			     1.19   vs    4.84</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
